[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ……\n私、色々思い出そうとして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna... I was trying to piece it all together..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "前に遺跡に来た時も、同じようなことがあったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The same thing happened last time we were here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしかすると、ヴァレリアにとっては\n辛い思い出なのかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe these memories are painful for you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そういえば、前に来た時は……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Come to think of it, last time we were here...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、レスナ。少し前から考えていたんだけど、\n私に、レスナの夢の手助けをさせてもらえない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Resna? I've been thinking about this for a little while, but...would you let me help you with your dream?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これからもレスナのそばにいて、\n一緒に何かを作ったり、冒険したりしたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to stick together with you so we can make more things and go on more adventures together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それが、今の私のやりたいこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's...what I want to do from now on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一緒にやろう、ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do this together, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はまだ未熟だけど、ヴァレリアが隣にいれば、\nもっともっと頑張れそうな気がするよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I still need a lot more experience, but if you were with me, I think I'd work even harder!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、なんだか情けないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't help but feel a little inadequate..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "情けないことないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't be so hard on yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアこそ、背負い込みすぎないでね。\n辛かったら、私が半分背負ってあげるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And don't try to shoulder everything alone. If things get tough, I'll be here to share the burden."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア。これからも一緒に頑張ろうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's keep at it together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。レスナと居ると、なんだか楽しいもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Somehow, being with you makes me happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
